AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000091> "a relation between an independent continuant (the bearer) and a disposition, in which the disposition specifically depends on the bearer for its existence"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000091> "has disposition"@en)
