# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000882> (Phasengrenze (Realisierung))

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000882> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000882> "Phasengrenze (Realisierung)"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000882> "phase boundary (realization)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000882> "A phase boundary is a realizable entity that is realized by the transition between distinct phases."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000882> "Eine Phasengrenze ist eine realisierbare Einheit, die durch den Übergang zwischen verschiedenen Phasen realisiert wird."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000882> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000882> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000017>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000882> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020313>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000882> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020136>))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000896> (pressure)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000896> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000896> "Druck"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000896> "pressure"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000896> "a quality describing the force exerted per unit area in or on a material."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000896> "eine intensive Qualität, die die Kraft beschreibt, die pro Flächeneinheit in oder auf ein Material ausgeübt wird."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000896> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000896> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023043>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> (temperature)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> "Temperatur"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> "temperature"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> "Die Temperatur ist eine grundlegende intensive Qualität, die die durchschnittliche atomare oder molekulare Bewegung oder Schwingung eines Teils der Materie darstellt."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> "The temperature is a fundamental intensive quality representing the average atomic or molcular movement or vibration of a portion of matter."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023043>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968> (Temperaturänderungswerkzeug)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968> "Temperaturänderungswerkzeug"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968> "temperature change device"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968> "A device that is used for the alteration and adjustment of the temperature of a tangible object or the environment, e.g., a furnace and cooling media."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968> "Diese Entität beschreibt allgemein jedes Werkzeug, das zur Änderung und Einstellung der Temperatur eines materiellen Objekts oder der Umgebung verwendet wird, z. B. einen Ofen und Kühlmittel."@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000969> (Temperaturänderungsfunktion)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000969> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
