AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020128> "A thermodynamic system is a material entity whose parts are bearer of thermodynamic properties. A thermodynamic system environs a thermodynamic process by which the thermodynamic properties of the objects of the thermodynamic system change over time."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020128> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020128> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000053> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020313>)))
