AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132> "Dimension quality is a quality of a material entity that pertains to its measurable spatial extent, such as length, area, or volume"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132> "the wall thickness of a steel pipe is a dimension quality functionally related to its pressure resistance"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
