AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020227> "Rolle einer Entität, die in einer Lösung in geringer Konzentration vorhanden ist"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020227> "role of an entity that is present in minor concentration in a solution"@en)
